{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23927","headline":"尝黄醅新酎忆微之 · 白居易","name":"尝黄醅新酎忆微之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世间好物黄醅酒，天下闲人白侍郎。\n爱向卯时谋洽乐，亦曾酉日放粗狂。\n醉来枕麴贫如富，身後堆金有若亡。\n元九计程殊未到，瓮头一醆共谁尝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23927.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23927","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}